This directory and examples/iphone_agent are based on ESP32 iPhone Agent by Henry Yuan
https://github.com/onehumanbeing/esp32-iphone-agent

iphone_agent/iphone_agent.ino is adapted from hardware/hid_bridge/hid_bridge.ino of that
project, and flash.sh from hardware/flash.sh. Both are used under the MIT License below.
The rest of the upstream firmware is fetched at build time by flash.sh; its AirPlay receiver
(hardware/hid_bridge/src/airplay/) is GPL-3.0, see README.md.

